    "DSH 进程在本轮完成前退出（例如被强制结束、崩溃或关闭超时），重新启动后本轮已中止。未完成的工具调用结果未知。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DSH 进程在本轮完成前退出（例如被强制结束、崩溃或关闭超时），重新启动后本轮已中止。未完成的工具调用结果未知。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DSH exited before this turn finished, for example after a force quit, crash, or shutdown timeout. The turn was aborted on restart. Results of unfinished tool calls are unknown."
          }
        }
      }
    },
