    "自动审查": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自动审查"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Auto review"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自动审查不使用沙箱。每次原生工具调用和 PTC 内层调用前，都会由与当前 agent 相同的模型进行审查；审查拒绝的调用由你批准或拒绝。此功能仍属实验性，可能误放行或误拒绝，并会消耗额外 token。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自动审查不使用沙箱。每次原生工具调用和 PTC 内层调用前，都会由与当前 agent 相同的模型进行审查；审查拒绝的调用由你批准或拒绝。此功能仍属实验性，可能误放行或误拒绝，并会消耗额外 token。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Auto review does not use a sandbox. Before each native tool call and inner PTC call, the same model as the current agent reviews the action; you approve or reject calls denied by the review. This feature is experimental, may incorrectly allow or deny actions, and uses additional tokens."
          }
        }
      }
    },
